  "semantics": {
    "authority": "Declarations generate data only; node checks real principal and exact installation/resource generation. Resource revision alone never prevents reinstall/clone ABA. Each setting domain has separate permission; changed fields commit atomically after all checks. Context/output are defaults only and never grant capacity or admission.",
    "theme": "Dark default; authenticated node launch channel supplies saved resolved appearance with installation/resource generation before first visible frame. Palette exact fixed keys and six digit hex, custom IDs unique lowercase 1-32 and not builtins; active custom must exist; no CSS or URL values. No OS theme setup override.",
    "startup": "Default neither. One dedicated unprivileged service identity/storage/DeviceId for boot, login and app/API demand. Owner approval is helper-verified exact immutable transaction, never a public approval flag. Cancellation and commit have one durable terminal winner. Cancelled only after previous effective OS configuration and identity are restored and verified. Failure to restore is recovery_required. After committed cancellation reports already_committed. Requested and effective remain distinct. Effective observations are known (verified mode and exact identity) or unknown (reason, observation time, optional explicitly last-known configuration). Failed probe/rollback never invents an effective mode. Cancelled requires known verified restored observation; unknown configuration is recovery_required. Before applying any change, require a verified known prior effective configuration and exact service identity; unknown baseline refuses mutation as recovery_required/unavailable, never blind overwrite.",
    "schedule": "Node-observed IANA zone in protected settings; zone must be catalogued/validated. Recurring local wall-clock half-open intervals; end<=start wraps to following day with start day owning tail; equal endpoints means 24 hours. DST nonexistent occurrences skipped; repeated wall minutes covered in both occurrences. Day set nonempty and unique. Local clock/zone observation changes require recomputation before admission; client defaults cannot select zone silently. Matching explicit available windows override matching unavailable windows; no matching window defaults open. Manual pause denies admission; a live reservation denies admission to callers other than its node-authenticated holder before evaluating schedule and cannot be overridden by an available window. These local schedule choices never bypass node resource admission.",
    "setup": "Progress flags/notice acknowledgement never authorize membership, approval, workload readiness or downloads. Rerun setup reads same settings operations; governance controls invoke governance operations.",
    "streams": "Ordered resource stream; opaque cursors bind actual principal, permissions, resource and installation generation. Reauthorize every event; expired cursor produces cursor_expired and fresh inspect; disconnect detaches only.",
    "durability": "Node sole writer; complete validation then atomic CAS commit; crash-safe principal/resource-generation/payload-bound request deduplication returns identical prior result. Unknown fields rejected. All borrowed observations are data, not authority. Reject duplicate semantic keys even if values differ: feature choices by feature_id, interpreter overrides by simulator, custom themes by id, setup sections by section. Generic full-item list uniqueness is insufficient."
  },
